{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11515": "JEROME: 啊，总算到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11516": "JEROME: 外面有点乱，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11517": "ELIZABETH: 回来了，亲爱的，过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11518": "ELIZABETH: 渡海还顺利吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11519": "JEROME: 大概比我想的好些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11520": "JEROME: 好像只有我一个人晕船。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11521": "ELIZABETH: 我知道你在学校学得很好，抱歉还把你叫回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11522": "JEROME: 从某个方面来说吧，但愿回去以后，不用再被父亲那爱打官司的名声拖累。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11523": "JEROME: 这些东西真都不要了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11524": "ELIZABETH: 这些都是你父亲办公室里的，现在用不上了，除非有哪件让你舍不得，想留作纪念。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11525": "ELIZABETH: 债务还没查清，谁肯出好价，我就卖给谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11526": "JEROME: 都不知道家里还有动物标本。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11527": "ELIZABETH: 不进来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11528": "JEROME: 父亲为什么不好好记账……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11529": "JUNA: 嘿，杰罗姆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11530": "JEROME: 什么事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11531": "JEROME: 这到底是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11532": "JEROME: 会说话的……动物。我在做梦？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11533": "JUNA: 呃……对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11534": "JUNA: 你确实在做梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11535": "JEROME: 那么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish1-11536": "JUNA: 等等！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11537": "JUNA: 找到你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11538": "JUNA: 呃啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11539": "JUNA: 不管你是谁，我都不会放弃！他大概是全队最讲道理的人了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11540": "JUNA: 什么鬼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11541": "JUNA: 哦，真有你的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeVanish2-11542": "JUNA: 这也拦不住我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11543": "JUNA: 你好啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11544": "JEROME: 哦，你好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11545": "JEROME: 你一定是父亲的债权人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11546": "JEROME: 或者……别告诉我，他把你告上法庭了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11547": "JUNA: 啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11548": "JUNA: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11549": "JUNA: （人类的法律，我一点也不懂……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11550": "JUNA: 就当我是个……信使吧。只是来了解一下……事情怎么样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11551": "JEROME: 听出你不是莱奥尼亚人，我就放心了。不过恕我冒昧，听不出你的口音是哪儿的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11552": "JUNA: 我从，呃……东边来。你多半没听过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11553": "JEROME: 那就好。为了父亲的事，我已经见了好些莱奥尼亚的生意伙伴……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11554": "JEROME: 他们说的话，我常常连意思都弄不清。莱奥尼亚语可不是用来说实话的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeAddress-11555": "JUNA: 就当我的，呃……雇主什么都没告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11556": "JEROME: 你想知道什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11557": "先说说……这里到底发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11558": "JEROME: 是这样。我刚从医学院回家，处理父亲的遗产。他在去年冬天突然去世。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11559": "你被困在噩梦里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11560": "JEROME: “噩梦”未免夸张了些，不过确实不容易。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11561": "听说你父亲去世，我很遗憾。你现在还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11562": "JEROME: 最难熬的日子应该过去了。父亲快七十岁了，又有不少坏习惯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11563": "JEROME: 所以……也不算全无预料。但我很想他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11564": "你父亲欠了很多人的钱？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11565": "JEROME: 是，也不是。也有很多人欠他钱。他做的是收购、转卖产业的生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluhender1-11566": "JEROME: 回大学之前，理清这些就成了我的主要工作。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11567": "ELIZABETH: 杰罗姆，亲爱的，能用你学的医术帮帮我吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11568": "ELIZABETH: 我头疼得厉害。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11569": "JEROME: 失陪片刻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11570": "JUNA: 真想打一架，就来，现在，就在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11571": "JUNA: 哦，花样还真多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluInterrupt1-11572": "JUNA: （天，这家伙连噩梦都这么温和。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11573": "JEROME: 我甚至不知道从何下手……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11574": "你说父亲做买卖……卖什么来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11575": "JEROME: 很多东西。看来他一直卷在没完没了的诉讼里，这也是他赚钱的重要手段。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11576": "JUNA: 不是有一种……专门处理这类事的人类吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11577": "JEROME: 你说律师？不过算不算“人类”，有时确实值得怀疑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11578": "JEROME: 但父亲的案子都亲自谈。他没读完大学，却很擅长打民事官司。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11579": "到底有多少事要处理？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11580": "JEROME: 问题就在这里。法庭办事慢，新的传票和各种要求还在接连送来。哪怕他已经去世十个月了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11581": "可你不找别人代办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11582": "JEROME: 我巴不得立刻请律师，可费用很高。得先查清父亲的收入和债务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeA-11583": "JEROME: 一团乱麻。光查财产在哪儿，就可能耗掉今年剩下的时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11584": "JEROME: 回头想想，似乎难以避免。我对父亲的事务一无所知。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11585": "什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11586": "JEROME: 我对他的生意毫无兴趣，他也从不勉强。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11587": "难以避免的是，你父亲会……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11588": "JEROME: 死去？虽然是事实，可这想法真阴郁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11589": "JEROME: 我是说，我原以为自己会被拉去做他的那门生意，做不成医生了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11590": "JEROME: 进医学院前，我都在海峡的里恩一侧读书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11591": "JEROME: 想跟赫尔蒙特医生学外科，才去了首都的医学院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11592": "JEROME: 同学们一听说我是克莱芒·雷诺的儿子，就对我很冷淡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11593": "同学为什么生气？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11594": "JEROME: 原来，我父亲曾把他们许多人的父亲告上法庭。前前后后，几乎一个都没落下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11595": "JEROME: 他们大概以为，我也会设法占他们的便宜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11596": "你这么在意别人的感受，一定很难受吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11597": "JEROME: 真不愿承认，你这么快就看透了我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11598": "JEROME: 我并非一直如此。母亲说我更像祖父，说我“深思熟虑”，不过我想她的意思是“不爱说话”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11599": "JEROME: 入学第一年，我不光得学着当医生，还得学着当个业余外交官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11600": "JEROME: 大多数同学能把我忘了，我就很高兴。交朋友几乎想都不敢想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11601": "因为父亲的生意？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11602": "JEROME: 对，他那些商业官司完全出乎我的意料。他只在海峡的莱奥尼亚一侧与人争讼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeB-11603": "JEROME: 从没告过洛蕾恩的人，所以母亲和我完全不知道会有这些麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11604": "JEROME: 她该怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11605": "JEROME: 最让我挂心的，是母亲以后的生活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11606": "JUNA: （好，这个问题我倒知道怎么处理。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11607": "JUNA: 早该看出你离不开妈妈。这种孩子总是太好说话。得划清界限。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11608": "JUNA: 我总说，隔着水塘能看见你，就已经够近了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11609": "JUNA: 没必要你每句话都让她听到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeC-11610": "JEROME: 真不是那么回事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11611": "JEROME: 我只是不知道，怎么安排对母亲最好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11612": "到底怎么回事？她非得留着这座大房子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11613": "JEROME: 不。她在农场长大，又有一半莱奥尼亚血统，适应首都生活不成问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11614": "你怕她孤单？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11615": "JEROME: 担心守寡的母亲独居，也是人之常情。我是她唯一的孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11616": "好吧，那难在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11617": "JEROME: 可以把这里都卖了，搬去首都的小房子，可那样就得住在一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11618": "JEROME: 以我的身份和年纪，与母亲同住并不稀奇，同辈也不会因此轻视我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11619": "可有个特别的人会介意？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11620": "JEROME: 不管是好是坏，确实如此。你可以笑我浪漫得老派，可我一直清楚自己想娶谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11621": "JEROME: 从我们还是孩子起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11622": "JUNA: （这个可怜的家伙……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11623": "JUNA: 嗯，我能理解，一个，呃……“有主见”的姑娘，恐怕不想三个人住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11624": "JEROME: 有时我都怀疑，那位姑娘想不想两个人住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11625": "所以迟早得让亲爱的妈妈搬出去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11626": "JEROME: 更准确地说，年老的母亲一旦搬进来，就很难再请她搬走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11627": "JEROME: 得把握好分寸：让她住得近些，却又不能太近，免得最后变成两个人争着要我陪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11628": "JUNA: 看来你说要当外交官，还真没夸张。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11629": "JUNA: 听着，要是你喜欢的真是我想的那种女人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11630": "JUNA: （我明明知道是谁。这梦境真是越来越怪了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11631": "JUNA: 等她愿意安定下来，恐怕还有几年。说不定永远都不会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11632": "JUNA: 叶子还没长出来，何必急着啃树枝，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11633": "JEROME: 真奇特的说法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeCquestions-11634": "JEROME: 不过你多半是对的。眼下的麻烦已经够多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeOutlayer-11635": "JUNA: 又怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeOutlayer-11636": "JUNA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeOutlayer-11637": "JUNA: 好吧，他人是不错，可这也有点没完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11638": "JEROME: 顶着父亲的名声，不知道首都的人能不能真正接受我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11639": "别太在意别人怎么想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11640": "JEROME: 在首都，无论从事什么行业，名声都是一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11641": "那又怎样？不就是几个有钱人不喜欢你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11642": "JEROME: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11643": "JUNA: 跟你父亲纠缠不清的，全是有钱人吧？得先有钱，别人才会想拿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11644": "JUNA: 我不太了解人类，可大多数都不富。亚历肯定不富。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11645": "JUNA: 不如去帮助其他人？（反正我知道，你本来就想这么做……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11646": "JEROME: 我常这么想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11647": "JEROME: 祖父告诉过我：“他们能夺走钱财和土地，却永远夺不走你做过的好事。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11648": "JUNA: 他过得开心吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11649": "JEROME: 开心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11650": "谁都有敌人，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11651": "JEROME: 所以敌人的敌人，就是我的朋友？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeX-11652": "JEROME: 也许如此，可我不想按那种信条过日子。不是处处都得占上风。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11653": "JEROME: 不知道母亲以后该怎么办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11654": "她还年轻吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11655": "JEROME: 比父亲年轻不少，可她不适合从事什么职业。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11656": "JEROME: 我可不会把她送去济贫院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11657": "很多人都有这个麻烦，从来如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11658": "JEROME: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11659": "JUNA: 让母亲和心上人和平相处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11660": "JEROME: 这两位有多固执，实在很难向你形容。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11661": "JEROME: 别这么看我。她们都是莱奥尼亚人，其他地方完全不同。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11662": "你母亲说过，希望你退学吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11663": "JEROME: 没有……她绝不会这么说。她一直坚持让我完成学业。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11664": "JEROME: 父亲也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11665": "JUNA: 那也许该听听她自己怎么说，不管是好是坏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeY-11666": "JEROME: 总比自己瞎猜好些……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11667": "JEROME: 我不想让父亲留下的基业支离破碎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11668": "听着是他的问题，不是你的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11669": "JEROME: 法律不这么看，他的对手和债权人更不会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11670": "你真有本事在……法庭上赢过所有人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11671": "JEROME: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11672": "JUNA: 你父亲干了一辈子。不是冒犯，可你赶不上他的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11673": "JEROME: 不劳提醒我的不足。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11674": "JUNA: 不，我是说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11675": "JUNA: 你更擅长调解。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11676": "JUNA: 想想你整天和谁待在一起，不会调解也不行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11677": "JUNA: 为什么不……和父亲那些对手商量个办法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11678": "JUNA: 劝他们让步，能争取多少是多少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11679": "JEROME: 有些人一占优势，就会得寸进尺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11680": "JUNA: 是啊，那能怎么办？你不是要赢，只是要脱身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11681": "JEROME: 这倒是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11682": "可你要当医生，不是商人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluJeromeZ-11683": "JEROME: 整天泡在法庭，我什么都当不成。只会重走父亲的老路，还做得不如他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution-11684": "JUNA: （外面传来的？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11685": "JEROME: 我知道该怎么做了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11686": "JEROME: 回首都，开始和父亲的生意伙伴、对手们谈和解。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11687": "JEROME: 而且……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11688": "JEROME: 这些我早就做过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11689": "JUNA: 对啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11690": "JEROME: 那是什么时候？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11691": "JEROME: 我现在在哪儿？这不是我家，早卖掉了，所以……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11692": "JEROME: 怎么回事？我们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11693": "JUNA: 某种用噩梦搭成的魔法监狱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11694": "JUNA: 这里还有别的东西，和我们待在一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11695": "JEROME: 你刚才看到了我全部的……梦和记忆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11696": "JUNA: 是啊，伙计。不过说真的，我还盼着能看点更劲爆的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11697": "JEROME: 相信你会对看到的事……守口如瓶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11698": "JUNA: 嗯，我肯定能保证，不告诉任何人类。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11699": "JUNA: （等回到族群，你们这帮怪家伙的事，我可要一件不漏全讲出来。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11700": "JEROME: 其他人也在这附近吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11701": "JUNA: 应该是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11702": "JUNA: 不过，先问一句。你妈妈最后怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11703": "JEROME: 她再婚了。父亲去世时，她还算年轻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11704": "JEROME: 现在住在阿尔切斯特，和一位采矿工程师，还有他的三个女儿一起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeResolution2-11705": "JUNA: 行啊，妈妈，真有你的。"
}
